{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1", "title": "MiSTer FPGA Documentation (fork with editorial improvements)", "home_page_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "feed_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "MiSTer FPGA is an open source project that aims to recreate various classic computers, game consoles, and arcade machines, using modern hardware.", "icon": "assets/mister_kun_bw.svg", "authors": [{"name": "Kevin Coleman"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "title": "Home", "content_html": "<figure markdown>\n  ![MiSTer-kun Cat by hewhoisred and MiSTer Logo by Conrad Fenech](assets/logo_small.png){ align=center width=\"750\" }\n  <figcaption>MiSTer-...", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T01:27:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/crttable/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/crttable/", "title": "CRT Configuration Table", "content_html": "<h2>CRT Configuration Table</h2>\n<p>This table shows the <code>MiSTer.ini</code> settings required for each analog video output mode when connecting to a CRT.</p>\n<p>| Analog Video O...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/crttable.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T01:27:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/nativeres/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/nativeres/", "title": "Core Default Resolutions", "content_html": "<p>This chart shows each core's default native resolution, frequencies, and pixel clock at startup. These values are not static and are documented for reference...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/nativeres.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T01:27:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "title": "FAQ", "content_html": "<p>Answers to frequently asked questions about MiSTer. If something is missing, feel free to contribute by editing this page on GitHub with the Edit (pen) icon ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T01:27:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/saves/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/saves/", "title": "Game Saves", "content_html": "<p>Many MiSTer cores support in-game saves, either by simulating the original hardware's save features or with savestates. Most cores don't have savestates, but...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/saves.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T01:27:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/", "title": "\u30db\u30fc\u30e0", "content_html": "<figure markdown>\n  ![\u30df\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u304f\u3093\u732b\uff08\u4f5c\uff1ahewhoisred\uff09\u3068 MiSTer \u30ed\u30b4\uff08\u4f5c\uff1aConrad Fenech\uff09](assets/logo_small.png){ align=center width=\"750\" }\n  <figcaption>\u30df\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u304f\u3093\u732b\uff08\u4f5c\uff1ahewhoisre...", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/index.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T01:27:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/crttable/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/crttable/", "title": "CRT\u8a2d\u5b9a\u8868", "content_html": "<h2>CRT \u8a2d\u5b9a\u8868</h2>\n<p>\u3053\u306e\u8868\u306f\u3001CRT \u306b\u63a5\u7d9a\u3059\u308b\u969b\u306e\u5404\u30a2\u30ca\u30ed\u30b0\u6620\u50cf\u51fa\u529b\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u5fc5\u8981\u306a <code>MiSTer.ini</code> \u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u793a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>| Analog Video Out     | composite_sync= | vga_mode= | vga_sog= | direct_video= | vga_sca...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/crttable.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T01:27:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/nativeres/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/nativeres/", "title": "\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6", "content_html": "<p>\u3053\u306e\u8868\u306f\u5404\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u8d77\u52d5\u6642\u306e\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u30cd\u30a4\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6\u30fb\u5468\u6ce2\u6570\u30fb\u30d4\u30af\u30bb\u30eb\u30af\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u793a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u308c\u3089\u306e\u5024\u306f\u56fa\u5b9a\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304f\u3001\u3042\u304f\u307e\u3067\u53c2\u8003\u3068\u3057\u3066\u6587\u66f8\u5316\u3055\u308c\u305f\u3082\u306e\u3067\u3059\u3002\u304a\u4f7f\u3044\u306e\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u306e\u4e92\u63db\u6027\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u3067\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9</h2>\n<p>| \u30b3\u30a2             | \u30d0\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3 | \u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u30cd\u30a4\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6 | ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/nativeres.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T01:27:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/saves/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/saves/", "title": "\u30bb\u30fc\u30d6\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf", "content_html": "<p>\u591a\u304f\u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u3001\u5b9f\u6a5f\u306e\u30bb\u30fc\u30d6\u6a5f\u80fd\u3092\u518d\u73fe\u3059\u308b\u304b\u3001\u30bb\u30fc\u30d6\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30c8\u3067\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u4fdd\u5b58\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30bb\u30fc\u30d6\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30c8\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u306a\u3044\u30b3\u30a2\u304c\u591a\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u5bfe\u5fdc\u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u7740\u5b9f\u306b\u5897\u3048\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u5185\u30bb\u30fc\u30d6</h2>\n<p>\u591a\u304f\u306e\u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u5185\u30bb\u30fc\u30d6\u3092\u30a8\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\u3055\u308c\u305f\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30e1\u30e2\u30ea\u306b\u4fdd\u6301\u3057\u3001microSD \u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307e\u308c\u308b...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/saves.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T01:27:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/faq/", "title": "\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u8cea\u554f", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u8cea\u554f\u3078\u306e\u56de\u7b54\u3067\u3059\u3002\u4f55\u304b\u4e0d\u8db3\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308c\u3070\u3001\u53f3\u4e0a\u306e Edit\uff08\u30da\u30f3\uff09\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3\u304b\u3089 GitHub \u4e0a\u3067\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3092\u7de8\u96c6\u3057\u3066\u8ca2\u732e\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n<h2>MiSTer \u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066</h2>\n<h3>MiSTer \u306e\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u306f\u96e3\u3057\u3044\uff1f \u672c\u5f53\u306b\u3044\u3058\u304f\u308a\u56de\u3059\u306e\u304c\u597d\u304d\u306a\u6280\u8853\u8005\u5411\u3051\u306a\u306e\uff1f</h3>\n<p>\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3001\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3002\u3044\u3058...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T01:10:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/cd/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/cd/", "title": "CD-based ROMs", "content_html": "<p>CD image format support depends on the core. CUE/BIN and CHD are common, but some cores also accept ISO or other formats. Check the core's readme for the sup...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/cd.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T00:29:41+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/setup/games/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/setup/games/", "title": "Transferring Games", "content_html": "<p>The standard way to play games on MiSTer is from the MicroSD card. This guide covers copying games to the card directly or over the network. For NAS or USB s...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/setup/games.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T00:29:41+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/cd/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/cd/", "title": "CD\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u306eROM", "content_html": "<p>CD \u30a4\u30e1\u30fc\u30b8\u306e\u5bfe\u5fdc\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30de\u30c3\u30c8\u306f\u30b3\u30a2\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u7570\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002CUE/BIN \u3068 CHD \u304c\u4e00\u822c\u7684\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001ISO \u306a\u3069\u4ed6\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u4ed8\u3051\u308b\u30b3\u30a2\u3082\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5bfe\u5fdc\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30de\u30c3\u30c8\u306f\u30b3\u30a2\u306e readme \u3092\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f CD \u30a4\u30e1\u30fc\u30b8\u306e\u683c\u7d0d\u65b9\u6cd5\u3068\u3001USB CD \u30c9\u30e9\u30a4\u30d6\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3059\u308b\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h1>...</h1>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/cd.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T00:29:41+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/setup/games/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/setup/games/", "title": "\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306e\u8ee2\u9001", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u3067\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u904a\u3076\u6a19\u6e96\u7684\u306a\u65b9\u6cd5\u306f microSD \u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u304b\u3089\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9\u3067\u306f\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u3078\u76f4\u63a5\u3001\u307e\u305f\u306f\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u7d4c\u7531\u3067\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u30b3\u30d4\u30fc\u3059\u308b\u65b9\u6cd5\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002NAS \u3084 USB \u30b9\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30b8\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u306f<a href=\"../advanced/network.md\">\u9ad8\u5ea6\u306a\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af</a>\u3092\u53c2\u7167\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n<h2>games...</h2>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/setup/games.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T00:29:41+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/directvideo/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/directvideo/", "title": "Direct Video Adapter", "content_html": "<h2>Direct Video</h2>\n<p>Since autumn 2019, <em>Direct Video</em> has provided analog video output without an I/O board. It offers minimal latency comparable to the I/O boar...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/directvideo.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T14:45:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/directvideo/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/directvideo/", "title": "Direct Video\u30a2\u30c0\u30d7\u30bf\u30fc", "content_html": "<h2>Direct Video</h2>\n<p>2019\u5e74\u79cb\u4ee5\u964d\u3001<em>Direct Video</em> \u306f I/O \u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306a\u3057\u3067\u30a2\u30ca\u30ed\u30b0\u6620\u50cf\u51fa\u529b\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3057\u3066\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002I/O \u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306e VGA \u51fa\u529b\u306b\u5339\u6575\u3059\u308b\u6700\u5c0f\u30ec\u30a4\u30c6\u30f3\u30b7\u30fc\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4f7f\u3046\u306b\u306f <code>MiSTer.ini</code> \u3067 Direct Video \u3092\u6709\u52b9\u306b\u3057\u3001\u4e92\u63db\u6027\u306e\u3042\u308b HDMI-t...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/directvideo.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T14:45:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/addons/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/addons/", "title": "Add-on Boards", "content_html": "<figure markdown>\n  ![MiSTer FPGA Sandwich Punk Style Art by hewhoisred](img/misterpunk.png){ align=center width=\"400\" }\n  <figcaption>Artwork by Hewhoisred<...", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/addons.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:59:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/input/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/input/", "title": "Controllers", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer supports a wide variety of input devices. It also offers options for configuring them and several quality-of-life features that work in most (sometime...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/input.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:59:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "title": "PSX", "content_html": "<p>The Sony PlayStation (PSX) MiSTer core is the most feature-filled and heavily developed core so far:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple controller options</li>\n<li>Automatic BIOS region s...</li>\n</ul>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/psx.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:59:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/addons/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/addons/", "title": "\u62e1\u5f35\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9", "content_html": "<figure markdown>\n  ![MiSTer FPGA Sandwich Punk Style Art by hewhoisred](img/misterpunk.png){ align=center width=\"400\" }\n  <figcaption>Artwork by Hewhoisred<...", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/addons.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-24T13:59:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}]}